    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2537910/extras/60ee1a37f6823853e3836682acee33a5.avif?t=1744965725\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After a near-fatal car accident, Sahara B. Shabazz was in need of a blood transfusion ... and in need of one fast!!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fate had decided that on that very same night, a Korean, 7th dan, Taekwondo, black belt, gold medalist had left the windows closed and slept with the fan on after celebrating yet another gold medal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The next day, he was rushed to the hospital but it was too late to save him and as his last heroic act in life ... he had decided to donate his blood to Sahara B. Shabazz.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2537910/extras/1a39a9022c8d2cd827067da011aa9f95.avif?t=1744965725\" /></span><strong>Join Sahara B. Shabazz as she honours that Korean man's sacrifice by winning this martial arts tournament with the Taekwondo that flows in her veins.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THANK YOU FOR CHOOZING BLACK OTAKU 2: TAEKWONDO IS IN MY BLOOD!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hold-tight, massive.  Looking at a around mid/late 2026 release date! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wish List it now, tell your friends, tell your foes and tell that guy that's neither but he a'ight!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;CULTURE BROUGHT TO YOU ONCE AGAIN, ONLY FROM SMALL BUSINESS!&quot;</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bless.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2537910/extras/80a4ccd014100296aca81f394a29a8e5.avif?t=1744965725\" /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BLACK OTAKU 2: TAEKWONDO IS IN MY BLOOD ANIMATION AND COMBAT DESIGN CREATED BY:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-  A 3RD DAN BLACK BELT IN KOREAN TAEKWONDO (\ud0dc\uad8c\ub3c4)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- THE FORMER #2 TJ COMBO ON THE KILLER INSTINCT LEADERBOARDS</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- AN AWARD WINNING ARTIST</p>",
